  "body": "Batch compatible queued PostgreSQL reads and share article enrichment within each execution. Bounded routing, durable group commit, full cost-10 bcrypt and per-request JWT checks; no cross-request caches, schema changes or host tuning.\n\n197/197 conformance checks pass on both seeds, plus concurrent visibility, framing, rollback and recovery checks.\n\nFull repository scorer on MEGASERVER: **78,000 \u2192 92,000 users (+17.9%)**. Five-minute hold: 23,256 req/s, p95 408 ms, p99 509 ms, zero errors. App + PostgreSQL share 8 CPUs / 16 GiB; same-host generators, local comparison.\n",
